的感觉。</p><p>在色彩选择上，玻璃拟态通常使用柔和的颜色，配合透明度变化来创造层次。高饱和度的颜色可能会过于刺眼，因此建议使用低至中等饱和度的配色方案。背景图片或渐变应该足够复杂，以充分展示玻璃效果，但也不能过于花哨以至于分散用户注意力。</p><h3>CSS 实现</h3><pre><code>/* 基础玻璃卡片组件 */
.glass-card {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  box-shadow: 
    0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  padding: 24px;
  color: #fff;
}

/* 深色背景变体 */
.glass-card-dark {
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
}

/* 悬浮状态 */
.glass-card:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 
    0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

/* 带渐变背景的玻璃卡片 */
.glass-gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 0%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 100%
  );
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
}

/* 玻璃按钮 */
.glass-button {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 500;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.glass-button:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
}

.glass-button:active {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  transform: scale(0.98);
}
</code></pre><h3>响应式考虑</h3><p>玻璃拟态在移动设备上需要特别注意性能。 backdrop-filter 是一个计算密集型的操作，在低端设备上可能会导致卡顿。应该考虑使用 CSS @supports 规则来提供渐进增强的体验。</p><pre><code>/* 优雅降级 */
.glass-card {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  padding: 24px;
  color: #fff;
}

@supports (backdrop-filter: blur(20px)) {
  .glass-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }
}

/* 性能友好的替代方案 */
@supports not (backdrop-filter: blur(20px)) {
  .glass-card {
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 100%
    );
    /* 使用伪元素模拟模糊效果 */
    position: relative;
  }

  .glass-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: inherit;
    filter: blur(20px);
    z-index: -1;
    margin: -20px;
  }
}
</code></pre><h2 id="neumorphism">新拟态设计</h2><p>新拟态（Neumorphism）是介于拟态和扁平化之间的一种设计风格，它通过柔和的阴影和高光来创造出

的视觉效果。</p><h3>设计特点</h3><p>新拟态的核心特征包括：柔和的外阴影（凸起效果）和内阴影（凹陷效果）的组合；使用与背景相同或相近的颜色来创建阴影；缺乏明显的边框；凸起和凹陷的元素在视觉上保持一致。整体呈现出一种柔软、触觉、近乎有机的质感。</p><p>新拟态设计对颜色非常敏感。如果背景色改变，阴影颜色也需要相应调整。因此，新拟态设计通常配合可自定义主题的系统使用。此外，过度使用新拟态可能导致界面显得过于统一，缺乏视觉焦点。</p><h3>CSS 实现</h3><pre><code>/* 新拟态基础样式 */
:root {
  --bg-color: #e0e5ec;
  --shadow-light: #ffffff;
  --shadow-dark: #a3b1c6;
  --text-color: #4a5568;
}

.neu-raised {
  background: var(--bg-color);
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 
    8px 8px 16px var(--shadow-dark),
    -8px -8px 16px var(--shadow-light);
  padding: 24px;
}

.neu-inset {
  background: var(--bg-color);
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 
    inset 4px 4px 8px var(--shadow-dark),
    inset -4px -4px 8px var(--shadow-light);
  padding: 24px;
}

.neu-button {
  background: var(--bg-color);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px 32px;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--text-color);
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 
    6px 6px 12px var(--shadow-dark),
    -6px -6px 12px var(--shadow-light);
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.neu-button:hover {
  box-shadow: 
    4px 4px 8px var(--shadow-dark),
    -4px -4px 8px var(--shadow-light);
}

.neu-button:active {
  box-shadow: 
    inset 4px 4px 8px var(--shadow-dark),
    inset -4px -4px 8px var(--shadow-light);
}

/* 新拟态输入框 */
.neu-input {
  background: var(--bg-color);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--text-color);
  box-shadow: 
    inset 4px 4px 8px var(--shadow-dark),
    inset -4px -4px 8px var(--shadow-light);
  outline: none;
  width: 100%;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.neu-input:focus {
  box-shadow: 
    inset 6px 6px 12px var(--shadow-dark),
    inset -6px -6px 12px var(--shadow-light);
}

.neu-input::placeholder {
  color: #a0aec0;
}
</code></pre><h2 id="3d-interfaces">3D 界面设计</h2><p>3D 元素正在成为现代 UI 设计的重要组成部分。从简单的阴影和透视效果，到复杂的 3D 建模和动画，设计师正在探索如何在保持可用性的同时增加界面的深度和趣味性。</p><h3>CSS 3D 变换</h3><p>CSS transform 属性提供了强大的 3D 变换能力，可以创建透视、旋转、位移等效果。</p><pre><code>/* 3D 卡片翻转效果 */
.scene {
  perspective: 1000px;
  width: 300px;
  height: 400px;
}

.card-3d {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  position: relative;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

.card-3d:hover {
  transform: rotateY(180deg);
}

.card-face {
  position: absolute;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  backface-visibility: hidden;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 24px;
  color: white;
}

.card-front {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
}

.card-back {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);
  transform: rotateY(180deg);
}

/* 3D 悬浮效果 */
.float-3d {
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% {
    transform: translateY(0) rotateX(0) rotateY(0);
  }
  25% {
    transform: translateY(-20px) rotateX(5deg) rotateY(5deg);
  }
  50% {
    transform: translateY(-10px) rotateX(0) rotateY(0);
  }
  75% {
    transform: translateY(-15px) rotateX(-5deg) rotateY(-5deg);
  }
}

/* 3D 容器 */
.cube-container {
  perspective: 800px;
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
}

.cube {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  position: relative;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  transform: rotateX(-30deg) rotateY(45deg);
  animation: rotateCube 10s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes rotateCube {
  from { transform: rotateX(-30deg) rotateY(0deg); }
  to { transform: rotateX(-30deg) rotateY(360deg); }
}

.cube-face {
  position: absolute;
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.8), rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.8));
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 24px;
  color: white;
}

.cube-face.front  { transform: translateZ(100px); }
.cube-face.back   { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(100px); }
.cube-face.right  { transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(100px); }
.cube-face.left   { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(100px); }
.cube-face.top    { transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(100px); }
.cube-face.bottom { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(100px); }
</code></pre><h3>Three.js 3D 场景</h3><p>对于更复杂的 3D 场景，可以使用 Three.js 库来实现。</p><pre><code>// Three.js 3D 背景示例
import * as THREE from 'three';

class ThreeBackground {
  constructor(container) {
    this.container = container;
    this.init();
    this.createScene();
    this.animate();
    window.addEventListener('resize', () => this.onResize());
  }

  init() {
    this.scene = new THREE.Scene();
    this.camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(
      75,
      window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight,
      0.1,
      1000
    );
    this.renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ 
      alpha: true,
      antialias: true 
    });
    this.renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);
    this.renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));
    this.container.appendChild(this.renderer.domElement);

    this.particles = [];
    this.clock = new THREE.Clock();
  }

  createScene() {
    const particleGeometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.5, 16, 16);
    const particleMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ 
      color: 0x667eea,
      transparent: true,
      opacity: 0.8
    });

    for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {
      const particle = new THREE.Mesh(particleGeometry, particleMaterial);
      particle.position.x = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 50;
      particle.position.y = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 50;
      particle.position.z = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 50;
      particle.scale.x = particle.scale.y = particle.scale.z = Math.random();
      this.particles.push({
        mesh: particle,
        speed: Math.random() * 0.02 + 0.01
      });
      this.scene.add(particle);
    }

    this.camera.position.z = 30;
  }

  animate() {
    requestAnimationFrame(() => this.animate());

    const elapsedTime = this.clock.getElapsedTime();

    this.particles.forEach((p, i) => {
      p.mesh.position.y += Math.sin(elapsedTime + i) * p.speed;
      p.mesh.rotation.x += p.speed * 0.5;
      p.mesh.rotation.y += p.speed * 0.3;
    });

    this.scene.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;

    this.renderer.render(this.scene, this.camera);
  }

  onResize() {
    this.camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;
    this.camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
    this.renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);
  }

  destroy() {
    window.removeEventListener('resize', this.onResize);
    this.renderer.dispose();
    this.container.removeChild(this.renderer.domElement);
  }
}

export default ThreeBackground;
</code></pre><h2 id="dark-mode">深色模式设计</h2><p>深色模式已成为现代应用的标准功能。正确实现深色模式不仅仅是简单的颜色反转，而是需要精心设计的配色方案和过渡效果。</p><h3>设计系统配色</h3><pre><code>:root {
